{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"正在面对\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-1\",\n      \"text\": \"从前他总想退回那份安宁，觉得这样才护得住向往的生活；可妨碍它的事还是会照旧。\",\n      \"key\": \"退回安宁\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-2\",\n      \"text\": \"这回他带着对那种生活的牵挂往前，发现眼前做的事也在替它争取，旧愿反倒近了些。\",\n      \"key\": \"替它争取\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-3\",\n      \"text\": \"他不再觉得惦记那种生活会拖住自己，反而更有劲往前做事。\",\n      \"key\": \"更有劲\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-4\",\n      \"text\": \"他觉得那种生活值得费力争取，却怕一味硬撑会磨掉其中的温柔，便留心自己怎么做。\",\n      \"key\": \"费力争取\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-5\",\n      \"text\": \"经历过怀疑和疲惫，他想起那种生活仍会高兴，没能过上它也不等于从前的快乐是假的。\",\n      \"key\": \"快乐是假的\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-6\",\n      \"text\": \"他不再拿心里的安慰顶替该做的事，也不拿忙着做事压下想念。\",\n      \"key\": \"压下想念\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-7\",\n      \"text\": \"那种生活还没实现，眼前的事能不能改变什么、最后能护住多少，他仍没把握。\",\n      \"key\": \"没把握\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-8\",\n      \"text\": \"真要付出代价，他还是可能累得想退回那份安宁。\",\n      \"key\": \"付出代价\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\", \"B4\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-9\",\n      \"text\": \"他不再靠拼命证明自己该往前，松下来后仍清楚想护住什么。\",\n      \"key\": \"松下来\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B4\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-6\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S12-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"限制\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-6\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-5\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-6\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S12-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-6\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S12-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-7\",\n      \"rel\": \"限制\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-8\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-7\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-8\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S05-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-9\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-9\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R65\", \"R66\", \"R67\", \"R68\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-1\", \"S13-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"拆并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留过去想退回安宁保护旧愿的想法，也说清退回去不能改变妨碍它的事。再写出带着牵挂行动后，旧愿反而靠近，完成从退路到行动理由的改写。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R69\", \"R76\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-4\", \"S13-7\"],\n      \"what\": \"拆分改写\",\n      \"why\": \"明确那种生活值得他费力争取，同时保留硬撑可能磨损温柔的顾虑，说明他开始在意怎样行动。行动未必改变现实的限制另由S13-7承担，避免重复，也补回值得付出这一侧。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R70\", \"R71\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-2\", \"S13-3\", \"S13-6\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"不再由作者宣布两种心意已经整合，而是写旧愿怎样进入眼前的行动，牵挂怎样从拖累变成动力，以及他怎样不再用忙碌压下想念。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R72\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-5\"],\n      \"what\": \"保留改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留怀疑和疲惫之后，想起那种生活仍会高兴的事实，也保留生活尚未实现不等于过去的快乐是假的。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R73\", \"R74\", \"R77\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-7\", \"S13-8\"],\n      \"what\": \"拆分合并\",\n      \"why\": \"S13-7保留行动结果和最终能护住多少仍未知；S13-8保留未来付出代价时可能疲惫、想退回安宁的风险。两种不确定性各有具体内容，不再重复总结冲突。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R75\", \"R78\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-6\", \"S13-9\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留行动和内心安宁各自真实、谁也不能替代谁，也保留他不再需要拼命证明自己该向前。删去重复的忘掉哪一边的原则，用松劲之后仍清楚想护住什么收束。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": [\n    {\n      \"bead\": \"B1\",\n      \"why\": \"故土、共同记忆是听感带出的联想，前文没有对应的具体经历，不能写成他的个人记忆。旧愿进入行动可以解释希望感和柔软与力量并存，但不能替他补出共同记忆。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "ac2269fa-a052-4338-a05d-c297df42d64c", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T233343803441Z", "elapsed_seconds": 114.547, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T23:35:38.355186+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "307293c576a54f32ecb69b24ca52a51d47a442a0518a400c887e4ca736a64221", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T233343803441Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "90f0dade1ce89728979935cdd8b4d0e3a64dac4b564f879b8cdf8de60450a286"}}}
